# Country pressure multiplier table for BFD
#
# Format: CC=multiplier (integer scale: 10 = 1.0x, 20 = 2.0x, 5 = 0.5x)
# Unlisted countries default to 10 (1.0x, no adjustment).
#
# Only active when PRESSURE_COUNTRY="1" in conf.bfd.
# Edit this file to adjust pressure weights by country of origin.
#
# Examples:
#   CN=20    # 2.0x — double pressure for traffic from China
#   US=10    # 1.0x — no adjustment for US traffic
#   DE=8     # 0.8x — slightly reduced pressure for Germany
#
# Common high-risk origins (uncomment and adjust as needed):
#CN=20
#RU=20
#KP=30
#IR=15
#
# Trusted origins (uncomment to reduce sensitivity):
#US=8
#GB=8
#DE=8
#CA=8
#AU=8
